OL,3,GNEWSAParents patrol school crossing
OL,4,Aafter children hit
OL,5,
OL,6,FParents have begun patrolling a zebra
OL,7,Fcrossing outside a school in
OL,8,FPeterborough amid fears speeding
OL,9,Fdrivers could cause a serious accident.
OL,11,FElliott and Joanne have been helping
OL,12,Fpupils cross safely near Dogsthorpe
OL,13,FAcademy on Central Avenue. They said
OL,14,Fthey believed three children had been
OL,15,Fstruck by cars "in the space of a
OL,16,Fweek".
OL,18,FCambridgeshire Police said two children
OL,19,Fsustained minor injuries in separate
OL,20,Fcollisions with cars on Central Avenue
OL,21,Fon 24 and 25 September.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
