OL,3,GNEWSAParents patrol school crossing
OL,4,Aafter children hit
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeterborough City Council said it was
OL,7,Faware of parents' concerns and it would
OL,8,Fassess the situation during a site
OL,9,Fvisit later this week.
